WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:08.660
Bulgaria is a country nestled in the southeastern corner of Europe.

2
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.543
Not much is heard about it on the news, and it is still largely undiscovered by tourists.

3
00:00:14.183 --> 00:00:16.644
It lies north of Greece and south of the Danube River.

4
00:00:17.345 --> 00:00:21.087
To its east is the Black Sea, and its neighbor to the west is Serbia.

5
00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.769
Bulgaria is one of the oldest settled lands in all of Europe.

6
00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.492
It has a rich history and diverse customs, and its people are proud of their heritage.

7
00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:34.476
The Bulgarians have a rich tradition of celebrating festivals and gatherings.

8
00:00:35.737 --> 00:00:40.542
In the past Bulgaria was largely an agricultural nation because of its fertile soil.

9
00:00:41.343 --> 00:00:46.248
It produced an abundance of vegetables, fruits, grain, and products from farm animals.

10
00:00:46.928 --> 00:00:50.512
Today the country is industrialized, and many products are imported.

11
00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:54.176
Local farms, however, continue to grow a variety of harvests.

12
00:00:55.692 --> 00:01:01.114
The Bulgarian people continue to grow one item that has perfume companies from Paris to New York talking.

13
00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.416
It is very hard to produce, and it is very expensive.

14
00:01:04.976 --> 00:01:11.538
It is the pure rose oil extracted from a small pink rose named Rosa damascene, and it is

15
00:01:11.578 --> 00:01:13.739
an important ingredient in many perfumes.

16
00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.461
In the center of Bulgaria lies the Valley of the Roses.

17
00:01:18.921 --> 00:01:24.284
It is a fertile valley covered in tiny pink roses whose sweet aroma can be felt like a

18
00:01:24.344 --> 00:01:25.184
perfume in the air.

19
00:01:25.856 --> 00:01:29.578
The valley's moderate climate allows the roses to grow in perfect conditions.

20
00:01:30.198 --> 00:01:33.799
The local people have been cultivating these unique flowers for hundreds of years.

21
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:39.142
The farmers who live in the valley pick the roses when they start to bloom in the beginning

22
00:01:39.162 --> 00:01:39.582
of June.

23
00:01:40.222 --> 00:01:44.984
They gather the tiny buds very early in the morning, just before sunrise, because that is when the

24
00:01:45.024 --> 00:01:46.945
roses are still fresh and full of dew.

25
00:01:48.646 --> 00:01:54.248
Traditionally, it was the young girls and women who harvested the roses and collected them in their baskets.

26
00:01:54.828 --> 00:01:58.010
They would put the very first flower they picked in their hair for decoration.

27
00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:03.132
While they worked, they sang the traditional songs sung every year during the rose harvest.

28
00:02:03.753 --> 00:02:08.956
Today the production is much faster, but the roses are still picked by hand by local farmers.

29
00:02:10.336 --> 00:02:14.639
After the roses are picked, they are rushed to the rose distillery before the sun has a chance

30
00:02:14.679 --> 00:02:15.199
to dry them.

31
00:02:15.879 --> 00:02:20.001
Their petals are collected in large pots and pressed to extract tiny amounts of oil.

32
00:02:20.662 --> 00:02:24.564
It takes almost two tons of petals to produce just one pound of pure rose oil.

33
00:02:26.156 --> 00:02:28.858
The rose oil is very aromatic and very expensive.

34
00:02:29.539 --> 00:02:31.180
It is even more expensive than gold.

35
00:02:31.761 --> 00:02:38.466
Besides its use in perfumes, rose oil is used in medicines, cosmetics, soaps, and even in rose petal

36
00:02:38.486 --> 00:02:45.012
jam! Today picking the prized blossoms is the main industry in the Rose Valley, and this industry continues

37
00:02:45.052 --> 00:02:45.472
to grow.

38
00:02:47.074 --> 00:02:50.817
Every year the first day of picking is celebrated with an annual Rose Festival.

39
00:02:51.457 --> 00:02:54.440
This daylong festival is usually held in the first week of June.

40
00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:58.701
The pickers wear their traditional costumes decorated with garlands of roses.

41
00:02:59.261 --> 00:03:01.562
They hold a beauty contest and choose a Rose Queen.

42
00:03:02.202 --> 00:03:06.943
Later when the harvest is over, the Rose Queen rewards the most skilled picker with a crown.

43
00:03:08.544 --> 00:03:13.025
The title of Rose Queen is an important honor for the lucky girl who receives it, and the

44
00:03:13.065 --> 00:03:15.446
festival itself has become a celebration of beauty.

45
00:03:16.086 --> 00:03:21.067
Since roses are a symbol of beauty and because the flowers are used in the beauty industry, the

46
00:03:21.107 --> 00:03:24.468
festival organizers felt that they needed to nominate a beauty queen.

47
00:03:25.076 --> 00:03:26.658
That's how the Rose Queen was born.

48
00:03:28.139 --> 00:03:34.064
Many Bulgarian actors, musicians, and circus performers flock to the Rose Valley every year to perform in the

49
00:03:34.104 --> 00:03:39.389
festival. It has even become an international destination for tourists from all over the world.

50
00:03:40.029 --> 00:03:45.234
The Rose Festival ends with a carnival where local people dress up in costumes and dance all night

51
00:03:45.294 --> 00:03:51.980
long. The very first Rose Festival was held in 1903 in the nearby town of Kazanlak.

52
00:03:52.456 --> 00:03:57.601
It slowly grew from a small gathering of rose pickers to a national event with many towns and

53
00:03:57.641 --> 00:03:58.802
villages participating.

54
00:03:59.423 --> 00:04:04.567
It keeps the traditions associated with the rose harvest alive, and it makes the local farmers very proud

55
00:04:04.607 --> 00:04:05.188
of their labor.

56
00:04:06.309 --> 00:04:11.854
Bulgarians are very proud of their rose oil production, which carries the name of their country far and

57
00:04:11.874 --> 00:04:16.698
beyond. They feel that the rose is the queen of all flowers, and that is why they have

58
00:04:16.718 --> 00:04:18.440
picked it to be their national flower.

59
00:04:20.276 --> 00:04:23.058
Today the Rose Festival and the harvest go hand in hand.

60
00:04:23.698 --> 00:04:30.102
Local people gather to celebrate the beautiful tradition of rose picking, and international companies continue to import the

61
00:04:30.142 --> 00:04:33.064
best rose oil in the world from the Valley of the Roses.
